\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M,s,t,a\\in V\">\\(L,M,s,t,a\\in V\\)</span> (language, canonical structure, assignment, term, and value candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S\\)</span> (canonical model-theoretic interfaces from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (the shared term-evaluation and formula-satisfaction recursion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}term\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S(M,L,s,t,a)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\n\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land a=\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}term\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S(M,L,s,t,a)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\n\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land a=\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The term value is now read from the same canonical structure projections and evaluation recursion used by satisfaction. The former private four-tuple encoding disagreed with the registered language and structure encodings.</li>\n<li>The upstream recursion determines a unique value in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span> for every term and legal assignment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,M,s,t,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}term\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6TermValue}_S(M,L,s,t,a)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\n\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\n\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land a=\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)","display":false}],"bytes":1723,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2773","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-model6-term-value.md|58-df-zfc-model6-term-value]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9b8711cda3f31ca","64f35ba2e87964e0","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}